{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2co-9-1","title":"2 Corinthians 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He yields the reason why, though he knew their forwardness, yet he sent Titus and his brethren beforehand. 6 And he proceeds in stirring them up to a bountiful alms, as being but a kind of sowing of seed, 10 which shall return a great increase to them, 13 and occasion a great sacrifice of thanksgivings unto God.</p>\n<p>touching. Ge 27:42; 1Sa 20:23; 2Ki 22:18; Job 37:23; Ps 45:1; Mt 22:31 Ro 11:28; Php 3:5,6 the ministering. 12-14; 8:4-15; Ga 2:10; 6:10 it is. 1Th 4:9,10; 5:1; 1Jo 2:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-2","title":"2 Corinthians 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the forwardness. 8:8,10,19; 1Th 1:7 I boast. 8:24 that. 1:1; 8:10; 1Co 16:15 provoked. 8:8; Heb 10:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-3","title":"2 Corinthians 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>have. 4; 7:14; 8:6,17-24 ye may. 5; 1Co 16:1-4; Tit 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-4","title":"2 Corinthians 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>they. 2; 8:1-5 be ashamed. 8:24; 11:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-5","title":"2 Corinthians 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>and make. 8:6; 1Co 16:2 bounty. Gr. blessing. Ge 33:11; 1Sa 25:27; 30:26; *marg: 2Ki 5:15 whereof ye had notice before. or, which hath been so muchspoken of before.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-6","title":"2 Corinthians 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I say. 1Co 1:12; 7:29; 15:20; Ga 3:17; 5:16; Eph 4:17; Col 2:4 He which soweth sparingly. 10; Ps 41:1-3; Pr 11:18,24; 19:17; 22:9; Ec 11:1,6; Lu 6:38 Lu 19:16-26; Ga 6:7-9; Heb 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-7","title":"2 Corinthians 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>not. De 15:7-11,14; Pr 23:6-8; Isa 32:5,8; Jas 5:9; 1Pe 4:9 God. 8:12; Ex 25:2; 35:5; 1Ch 29:17; Pr 11:25; 22:9; Ac 20:35; Ro 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-8","title":"2 Corinthians 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>God. 2Ch 25:9; Ps 84:11; Pr 3:9; 10:22; 11:24; 28:27; Hag 2:8; Mal 3:10 Php 4:18 all grace. 8:19; 1Pe 4:10 always. 11; 1Ch 29:12-14 may. 8:2,7; Ac 9:36; 1Co 15:58; Eph 2:10; Col 1:10; 2Th 2:17; 2Ti 3:17 Tit 2:14; 3:8,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-9","title":"2 Corinthians 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>He hath dispersed. Ps 112:9 his. Ps 112:3; Pr 8:18; 21:21; Isa 51:8; 1Co 13:13; Ga 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-10","title":"2 Corinthians 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he. Ge 1:11,12; 47:19,23,24; Isa 55:10 multiply. 6; Pr 11:18; Ec 11:6; Php 4:17 increase. Ho 10:12; Mt 6:1; Eph 5:9; Php 1:11; 1Th 3:12; 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-11","title":"2 Corinthians 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>enriched. 8:2,3; 1Ch 29:12-14; 2Ch 31:10; Pr 3:9,10; Mal 3:10,11; 1Ti 6:17,18 bountifulness. or, liberality. Gr. simplicity. 8:2; *Gr: Ro 12:8 which. 12; 1:11; 4:15; 8:16,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-12","title":"2 Corinthians 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the administration. 1; 8:4 only. 8:14,15; Php 2:25; 4:18,19; Phm 1:4-7; Jas 2:14-16; 1Jo 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-13","title":"2 Corinthians 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>they. Ps 50:23; Mt 5:16; Joh 15:8; Ac 4:21; 11:18; 21:19,20; Ga 1:24 1Pe 2:9; 4:11 professed. 10:5; Lu 6:46; Ro 10:16; 16:26; Heb 5:9 and for. Heb 13:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-14","title":"2 Corinthians 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>by. 1:11; Ezr 6:8-10; Ps 41:1,2; Pr 11:26; Lu 16:9; Php 4:18,19 2Ti 1:16-18 long. 2Sa 13:29; Ro 1:11; Php 1:8; 2:26; 4:1 the exceeding. 8:1,6,7; 1Co 1:4,5; 1Ti 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2co-9-15","title":"2 Corinthians 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2CO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Thanks. 11; 2:14; 1Ch 16:8,35; Ps 30:4,12; 92:1; Lu 2:14,38; 1Co 15:57 Eph 5:20; Jas 1:17; Re 4:9 his. Isa 9:6; 49:6; Joh 1:16; 3:16; Ro 6:23; 8:32; 1Jo 4:9,10; 5:11,12</p>"}]}